## A note on AI

AI is a tool here, not the topic. You may use it for brainstorming, learning a new technology, drafting, and code assistance. You must be able to explain and defend everything you submit — unexplained AI-generated work is treated like any other unverified contribution. Disclose substantial use where it materially shaped an artifact.

